      "created_at": "2019-11-06T00:58:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Christopher had&nbsp;reply about a question on what the chapters are about:</p>\n<p>\n&gt; </p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Close! Chapter 4 and Chapter 5 are the GM-facing versions of Chapters 2 and 3.</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Chapter 2 is How To Play</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Chapter 3 is Hero Creation</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Chapter 4 is How to GM</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Chapter 5 is [Minion/Lieutenant/Villain/Challenge/Environment/Scene/etc.] Creation</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>And thus, you might guess that chapter 5 is massive and taking longer than just about any other chapter. And you'd be right. But you'll have it soon!</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>\n</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
